        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we operate a laboratory facility located in California and licensed by California’s DHS, California law is applicable to our business arrangements.",
        "start_character": 88503,
        "end_character": 88658
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we operate a laboratory facility located in Texas, our business arrangements are subject to certain Texas laws.",
        "start_character": 90124,
        "end_character": 90243
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Therefore, we are required to meet certain laboratory licensing requirements for those states in which we offer services or from which we accept specimens, and that have adopted laboratory regulations beyond CLIA.",
        "start_character": 65581,
        "end_character": 65794
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To the extent that we collect data that does not fall within an exception to these privacy laws, we may be required to make specific disclosures in privacy notices, take additional compliance steps such as DPIAs, and afford residents with certain rights concerning their personal information, which may require us to change the way we conduct our business or provide our products and services.",
        "start_character": 78382,
        "end_character": 78775
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also subject to the Physician Self-Referral law, commonly known as the Stark Law, which prohibits, with certain exceptions, an ownership or financial arrangement with a physician (or a physician’s immediate family member) in exchange for the referral of designated health services, including clinical laboratory services, or presenting or causing to be presented claims to Medicare and Medicaid for such services referred by the physician.",
        "start_character": 95284,
        "end_character": 95730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are subject to California’s Physician Ownership and Referral Act, or PORA, which generally prohibits us from billing a patient or any governmental or commercial third-party payer for any laboratory services when the physician ordering the service, or any member of such physician’s immediate family, has a “financial interest” with us, unless the arrangement meets an exception (CA Business and Professions Code Section 650.02).",
        "start_character": 99065,
        "end_character": 99496
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to seek patent protection as we develop new technologies and products in this area.",
        "start_character": 44127,
        "end_character": 44220
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide services and digital capabilities intended to simplify the testing process, reduce administrative burden, and support clinical decision-making across our oncology, women’s health, and organ health portfolios.",
        "start_character": 38052,
        "end_character": 38271
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We support our testing portfolio with a phlebotomy network designed to improve patient access.",
        "start_character": 38890,
        "end_character": 38984
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a health care provider, we are subject to Section 4004 of the 21st Century Cures Act, or Cures Act, and regulations promulgated by HHS related to patient access to electronic PHI, or EHI, to promote interoperability and to ensure the access, exchange, or use of EHI.",
        "start_character": 76679,
        "end_character": 76948
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As with oncology, we are continuing to generate data in multiple clinical studies designed to demonstrate clinical utility and other benefits of our Prospera test.",
        "start_character": 33268,
        "end_character": 33431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-020881",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-020881-92bdb62233718e63",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-020881",
